OL,3,GNEWSAPolice acted 'acceptably' before
OL,4,Aman died - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers acted "acceptably" in
OL,7,Fthe days before a man who they had
OL,8,Farrested took his own life, an internal
OL,9,Finvestigation has ruled.
OL,11,FNoel Porter, 25, from Woodbridge,
OL,12,FSuffolk, was found dead in a car park
OL,13,Fin Ipswich on 22 November 2023, a day
OL,14,Fafter admitting to drink driving at
OL,15,FIpswich Magistrates' Court.
OL,17,FAt Suffolk Coroner's Court on Friday, a
OL,18,Fjury said that his mental health risks
OL,19,Fwere "insufficiently" shared between
OL,20,FSuffolk Police, Serco prison transport
OL,21,Fworkers and the magistrates' court
OL,22,Fafter his arrest.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
